#: kplayer.cpp:484
msgid ""
"The Main toolbar contains buttons for commonly used operations. Left "
"clicking an icon will activate the corresponding action. Some of the buttons "
"will pop up slider controls when clicked. The sliders let you change various "
"player controls: sound volume, video contrast, brightness, hue and "
"saturation. The video controls will only be available for video files."
msgstr ""
"Glavna traka alatki sadrži dugmad za često korišćene radnje. Lijevi klik na "
"ikonu će aktivirati odgovarajuću radnju. Neki od dugmića će učiniti da, kada "
"kliknete na njih, iskoči klizač za kontrolu. Klizači vam omogućavaju da "
"mijenjate razne kontrole plejera: jačinu zvuka, kontrast slike, osvetljaj, "
"boju i zasićenje. Kontrole za podešavanje slike će biti dostupne samo pri "
"puštanju video datoteka."

#: kplayer.cpp:485
msgid ""
"The Playlist toolbar shows the multimedia title currently loaded or being "
"played, offers commands to go to the next or previous items on the playlist, "
"and also lets you see the entire playlist of items that are currently being "
"played or have been played recently. If you select a different item from the "
"list, KPlayer will load and start playing it. The toolbar also contains "
"options to loop and shuffle the playlist."
msgstr ""
"Traka alatki liste puštanja prikazuje naslov koji je trenutno učitan ili "
"pušten, nudi naredbe za prelazak na sljedeću ili prethodnu stavku i takođe "
"omogućava da vidite cjelokupnu listu koja sadrži stavke koje se trenutno "
"puštaju ili su puštane nedavno. Ako izaberete drugu stavku sa liste, "
"K‑plejer će je učitati i pustiti. Traka takođe sadrži opcije za kruženje i "
"miješanje liste puštanja."

#: kplayer.cpp:486
msgid ""
"The 'Progress and Seeking' toolbar is shown when the time length of a media "
"file is known. It displays the playback progress and also allows seeking, "
"that is, moving the playback point back and forth within the file. To seek "
"to a specific position, drag the slider thumb to that position with the left "
"mouse button, or simply click at that position with the middle mouse button. "
"To move forward or backward in steps, left click the slider to the left or "
"right of the thumb, or click the Forward and Backward buttons."
msgstr ""
"Traka napretka i traženja je prikazana kada je poznato trajanje datoteke. "
"Ona prikazuje napredak puštanja i takođe dozvoljava traženje, to jest, "
"pomeranje puštanja naprijed i nazad unutar datoteke. Da biste preskočili na "
"određeno mjesto, lijevim tasterom miša odvucite klizač do njega, ili "
"jednostavno tu kliknite srednjim tasterom miša. Pomeranje naprijed ili nazad "
"u koracima vrši se lijevim klikom miša na traku, lijevo ili desno od "
"klizača, ili klikom na dugmad Naprijed i Nazad."

#: kplayer.cpp:487
msgid ""
"The Volume toolbar has a volume slider that shows the current sound volume "
"and allows you to change it. This is the same slider that can be reached "
"using the volume pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but it will not "
"disappear when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using "
"the Show Volume Toolbar option on the Settings menu. Clicking the Volume "
"button on this toolbar will also hide it. In addition the toolbar has a Mute "
"button that can be used to toggle whether the sound is on or off."
msgstr ""
"Traka za jačinu zvuka ima klizač koji prikazuje trenutnu jačinu zvuka i "
"omogućava da je mijenjate. Ovo je isti klizač kao i iskačući klizač koji "
"dobijate klikom na dugme za jačinu zvuka sa glavne trake alatki ali neće "
"nestati ako kliknete negdje drugdje. Možete je prikazati ili sakriti "
"koristeći opciju Prikaži traku jačine zvuka iz menija Podešavanje. Klik na "
"dugme sa zvučnikom na ovoj traci takođe će je sakriti. Kao dodatak, traka "
"ima i dugme za potpuno isključenje i ponovno uključenje zvuka. (precrtani "
"zvučnik)"

#: kplayer.cpp:488
msgid ""
"The Contrast toolbar has a contrast slider that shows the current video "
"contrast and allows you to change it. This is the same slider that can be "
"reached using the contrast pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but it "
"will not disappear when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the "
"toolbar using the Show Contrast Toolbar option on the Settings menu. "
"Clicking the Contrast button on this toolbar will also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Traka za kontrast ima klizač koji prikazuje trenutni kontrast slike i "
"omogućava da ga mijenjate. Ovo je isti klizač kao i iskačući klizač koji "
"dobijate klikom na dugme za kontrast sa glavne trake alatki ali neće nestati "
"ako kliknete negdje drugdje. Možete je prikazati ili sakriti koristeći "
"opciju Prikaži traku kontrasta iz menija Podešavanje. Klik na dugme na ovoj "
"traci takođe će je sakriti."

#: kplayer.cpp:489
msgid ""
"The Brightness toolbar has a brightness slider that shows the current video "
"brightness and allows you to change it. This is the same slider that can be "
"reached using the brightness pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but "
"it will not disappear when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the "
"toolbar using the Show Brightness Toolbar option on the Settings menu. "
"Clicking the Brightness button on this toolbar will also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Traka za osvetljaj ima klizač koji prikazuje trenutni osvetljaj slike i "
"omogućava da ga mijenjate. Ovo je isti klizač kao i iskačući klizač koji "
"dobijate klikom na dugme za osvetljaj sa glavne trake alatki ali neće "
"nestati ako kliknete negdje drugdje. Možete je prikazati ili sakriti "
"koristeći opciju Prikaži traku osvetljaja iz menija Podešavanje. Klik na "
"dugme na ovoj traci takođe će je sakriti."

#: kplayer.cpp:490
msgid ""
"The Hue toolbar has a hue slider that shows the current video hue and allows "
"you to change it. This is the same slider that can be reached using the hue "
"pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but it will not disappear when you "
"click elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using the Show Hue Toolbar "
"option on the Settings menu. Clicking the Hue button on this toolbar will "
"also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Traka za boju ima klizač koji prikazuje trenutnu obojenost slike i omogućava "
"da je mijenjate. Ovo je isti klizač kao i iskačući klizač koji dobijate "
"klikom na dugme za boju sa glavne trake alatki ali neće nestati ako kliknete "
"negdje drugdje. Možete je prikazati ili sakriti koristeći opciju Prikaži "
"traku boje iz menija Podešavanje. Klik na dugme na ovoj traci takođe će je "
"sakriti."

#: kplayer.cpp:491
msgid ""
"The Saturation toolbar has a saturation slider that shows the current video "
"saturation and allows you to change it. This is the same slider that can be "
"reached using the saturation pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but "
"it will not disappear when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the "
"toolbar using the Show Saturation Toolbar option on the Settings menu. "
"Clicking the Saturation button on this toolbar will also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Traka za zasićenje ima klizač koji prikazuje trenutno zasićenje slike i "
"omogućava da ga mijenjate. Ovo je isti klizač kao i iskačući klizač koji "
"dobijate klikom na dugme za zasićenje sa glavne trake alatki ali neće "
"nestati ako kliknete negdje drugdje. Možete je prikazati ili sakriti "
"koristeći opciju Prikaži traku zasićenja iz menija Podešavanje. Klik na "
"dugme na ovoj traci takođe će je sakriti."

#: kplayer.cpp:599
msgid ""
"The menu bar contains names of drop-down menus. Left click a name to "
"alternately show and hide that menu, or use Alt + the underlined letter in "
"the name as a hot key; for example, Alt+F shows the File menu."
msgstr ""
"Traka menija sadrži imena padajućih menija. Lijevim klikom na ime "
"prikazujete ili sakrivate taj meni, ili možete koristiti Alt + podvučeno "
"slovo u imenu menija kao tastersku kombinaciju. Na primjer <shortcut>Alt+F</"
"shortcut> prikazuje Datoteka meni."

#: kplayer.cpp:600
msgid ""
"The status bar shows general information about the player's status and "
"progress."
msgstr "Traka stanja prikazuje opšte podatke o stanju plejera i napretku."

#: kplayer.cpp:640
msgid "Quits KPlayer"
msgstr "Napušta K‑plejer"

#: kplayer.cpp:641
msgid ""
"The 'Quit' command saves the playlist and all settings, stops playing and "
"closes KPlayer."
msgstr ""
"Naredba „Napusti“ upisuje listu puštanja i sve postavke, zaustavlja puštanje "
"i zatvara K‑plejer."

#: kplayer.cpp:644 kplayer.cpp:1817
msgid "Shows/hides the menu bar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/skriva traku menija"

#: kplayer.cpp:645
msgid "The 'Show Menu Bar' command shows or hides the menu bar."
msgstr "Naredba „Prikaži traku menija“ prikazuje ili skriva traku menija."

#: kplayer.cpp:648 kplayer.cpp:1829
msgid "Shows/hides the status bar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/skriva traku stanja"

#: kplayer.cpp:649
msgid "The 'Show Status Bar' command shows or hides the status bar."
msgstr "Naredba „Prikaži traku stanja“ prikazuje ili sakriva traku stanja."

#: kplayer.cpp:654
msgid "&Show Playlist"
msgstr "Prikaži &listu puštanja"

#: kplayer.cpp:656
msgid "Shows/hides the playlist"
msgstr "Prikazuje i sakriva listu puštanja"

#: kplayer.cpp:657
msgid "The 'Show Playlist' command shows or hides the playlist toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži listu puštanja</interface> prikazuje ili skriva "
"traku liste puštanja."

#: kplayer.cpp:662
msgid "Sho&w Library"
msgstr "Prikaži &biblioteku"

#: kplayer.cpp:664
msgid "Shows/hides the multimedia library"
msgstr "Prikazuje/skriva multimedijsku biblioteku"

#: kplayer.cpp:665
msgid "The 'Show Library' command shows or hides the multimedia library."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži biblioteku</interface> prikazuje ili skriva "
"multimedijsku biblioteku."

#: kplayer.cpp:670
msgid "Show Message &Log"
msgstr "Prikaži &dnevnik poruka"

#: kplayer.cpp:672
msgid "Shows/hides the message log"
msgstr "Prikazuje/skriva dnevnik poruka"

#: kplayer.cpp:673
msgid "The 'Show Message Log' command shows or hides the message log."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži dnevnik poruka</interface> prikazuje ili skriva "
"dnevnik poruka."

#: kplayer.cpp:678
msgid "Show Main &Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži glavnu &traku alatki"

#: kplayer.cpp:679
msgid "Shows/hides the main toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/skriva glavnu traku alatki"

#: kplayer.cpp:680
msgid "The 'Show Main Toolbar' command shows or hides the main toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži glavnu traku alatki</interface> prikazuje ili "
"skriva glavnu traku alatki."

#: kplayer.cpp:685
msgid "Show &Progress Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži traku &napretka"

#: kplayer.cpp:686
msgid "Shows/hides the progress toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/sakriva traku napretka"

#: kplayer.cpp:687
msgid ""
"The 'Show Progress Toolbar' command shows or hides the progress toolbar. "
"This command is available when the time length of the current file is known."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži traku napretka</interface> prikazuje ili sakriva "
"traku napretka. Ova naredba je dostupna kada je vrijeme trajanja tekuće "
"datoteke poznato."

#: kplayer.cpp:692
msgid "Show &Volume Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži traku jačine &zvuka"

#: kplayer.cpp:694
msgid "Shows/hides the volume toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/sakriva traku jačine zvuka"

#: kplayer.cpp:695
msgid "The 'Show Volume Toolbar' command shows or hides the volume toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži traku jačine zvuka</interface> prikazuje ili "
"sakriva traku jačine zvuka."

#: kplayer.cpp:700
msgid "Show C&ontrast Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži traku &kontrasta"

#: kplayer.cpp:702
msgid "Shows/hides the contrast toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/sakriva traku kontrasta"

#: kplayer.cpp:703
msgid ""
"The 'Show Contrast Toolbar' command shows or hides the contrast toolbar. "
"This command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži traku kontrasta</interface> prikazuje ili sakriva "
"traku kontrasta. Ova naredba je dostupna za video datoteke."

#: kplayer.cpp:708
msgid "Show &Brightness Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži traku &osvetljaja"

#: kplayer.cpp:710
msgid "Shows/hides the brightness toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/sakriva traku osvetljaja"

#: kplayer.cpp:711
msgid ""
"The 'Show Brightness Toolbar' command shows or hides the brightness toolbar. "
"This command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži traku osvetljaja</interface> prikazuje ili "
"sakriva traku osvetljaja. Ova naredba je dostupna za video datoteke."

#: kplayer.cpp:716
msgid "Show H&ue Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži traku &boje"

#: kplayer.cpp:718
msgid "Shows/hides the hue toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje sakriva traku boje"

#: kplayer.cpp:719
msgid ""
"The 'Show Hue Toolbar' command shows or hides the hue toolbar. This command "
"is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži traku boje</interface> prikazuje ili sakriva "
"traku boje. Ova naredba je dostupna za video datoteke."

#: kplayer.cpp:724
msgid "Show &Saturation Toolbar"
msgstr "Prikaži traku za&sićenja"

#: kplayer.cpp:726
msgid "Shows/hides the saturation toolbar"
msgstr "Prikazuje/sakriva traku zasićenja"

#: kplayer.cpp:727
msgid ""
"The 'Show Saturation Toolbar' command shows or hides the saturation toolbar. "
"This command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Prikaži traku zasićenja</interface> prikazuje ili sakriva "
"traku zasićenja. Ova naredba je dostupna za video datoteke."

#: kplayer.cpp:730
msgid "Opens the KPlayer key bindings dialog"
msgstr "Otvara K‑plejerov dijalog za sveze tastera"

#: kplayer.cpp:731
msgid ""
"The 'Configure Shortcuts' command opens a dialog that allows you to see and "
"change KPlayer's shortcut key bindings, or associations between actions and "
"the corresponding keys or combinations of keys that activate them. If you "
"change the bindings, make sure not to duplicate an existing shortcut and "
"also not to use the Shift key for your new shortcuts, because the Shift key "
"has a special function in KPlayer."
msgstr ""
"Naredba „Podesi prečice“ otvara dijalog koji vam omogućava da vidite i "
"mijenjate sveze tastera za prečice K‑plejera ili pridruženja radnji i "
"odgovarajućih tastera ili kombinacija tastera koji ih aktiviraju. Ako "
"mijenjate sveze, provjerite da ne duplirate postojeće. Takođe nemojte "
"koristiti taster Shift za nove prečice, jer ima posebnu funkciju u K‑plejeru."

#: kplayer.cpp:734
msgid "Opens the KPlayer toolbar configuration dialog"
msgstr "Otvara dijalog za podešavanje K‑plejerove trake alatki"

#: kplayer.cpp:735
msgid ""
"The 'Configure Toolbars' command opens a dialog that allows you to see and "
"change KPlayer's toolbars and controls assigned to them."
msgstr ""
"Naredba „Podesi trake“ otvara dijalog koji omogućava da vidite i mijenjate "
"trake alatki K‑plejera i kontrole koje su im dodijeljene."

#: kplayer.cpp:738
msgid "Opens the KPlayer configuration dialog"
msgstr "Otvara dijalog za podešavanje K‑plejera"

#: kplayer.cpp:739
msgid ""
"The 'Configure KPlayer' command opens a dialog that allows you to configure "
"the program, modifying various aspects of its functionality, user interface "
"and interaction with MPlayer. For more information see the Configuration "
"dialog chapter in the user manual."
msgstr ""
"'Configure KPlayer' naredba otvara dijalog koji Vam dopušta da podesite "
"program,  promjene djeluju na njegovu funkcionalnost, korisnički interfejs i "
"interakciju sa MPlayer. Za više informacija pogledajte Configuration dijalog "
"dio u korisničkom priručniku."

#: kplayer.cpp:792 kplayer.cpp:803 kplayer.cpp:1107 kplayer.cpp:1174
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Spreman"

#: kplayer.cpp:793 kplayer.cpp:805 kplayer.cpp:1331
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "Miruje"

#: kplayer.cpp:815
msgid ""
"Status area of the status bar tells you if there have been playback errors."
msgstr ""
"Oblast stanja na traci stanja vam govori da li je bilo grešaka pri puštanju."

#: kplayer.cpp:818
msgid "State area of the status bar displays the current player state."
msgstr "Oblast stanja trake stanja prikazuje trenutno stanje plejera."

#: kplayer.cpp:820
msgid ""
"Progress area of the status bar shows playback progress and the total length "
"if known."
msgstr ""
"Oblast napretka trake stanja prikazuje napredak puštanja u ukupno trajanje, "
"ako je poznato."

#: kplayer.cpp:1331
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Radi"

#: kplayer.cpp:1331
msgid "Playing"
msgstr "Pušta"

#: kplayer.cpp:1331
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Pauzirano"

#: kplayer.cpp:1373
#, kde-format
msgid "Cache fill: %1%"
msgstr "Popunjavam keš: %1%"

#: kplayer.cpp:1374
#, kde-format
msgid "Generating index: %1%"
msgstr "Stvaram indeks: %1%"

#: kplayer.cpp:1375
#, kde-format
msgid "Transferring file: %1%"
msgstr "Prenosim datoteku: %1%"

#: kplayer.cpp:1405
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Greška"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:323 kplayerengine.cpp:946 kplayerengine.cpp:949
#: kplayerengine.cpp:952 kplayerproperties.cpp:3894
#, kde-format
msgid "Track %1"
msgstr "Numera %1"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:350
msgid "Norwegian"
msgstr "norveški"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:438
msgid "&None"
msgstr "&Ništa"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:439
msgid "Turns off subtitle display"
msgstr "Isključuje prikaz titlova"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:440
msgid "The 'Subtitles -- None' command turns off subtitle display."
msgstr "Naredba „Titlovi -- Ništa“ isključuje prikaz titlova."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:488
msgid "&Properties..."
msgstr "&Svojstva..."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:491
msgid "Opens the File Properties dialog"
msgstr "Otvara dijalog sa svojstvima datoteke"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:492
msgid ""
"Properties command opens the File Properties dialog that lets you choose "
"many options specific to the currently loaded file. See the File properties "
"chapter in the user manual for details."
msgstr ""
"Naredba Svojstva otvara dijalog svojstva datoteke koja Vam dopušta da "
"izaberete mnogo opcija za upravo učitanu datoteku. Vidite  poglavlje "
"Svojstva datoteke u korisničkom interfejsu za detalje."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:497 kplayernodeview.cpp:3291
msgid "&Play"
msgstr "&Pusti"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:500
msgid "Plays the currently loaded file"
msgstr "Pušta trenutno učitanu datoteku"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:501
msgid ""
"Play command starts playback of the current file. If the player has been "
"paused, this command resumes playback. This command is available when a file "
"is loaded."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Pusti</interface> pokreće puštanje tekuće datoteke. Ako "
"je plejer bio pauziran, ova naredba nastavlja puštanje. Naredba je dostupna "
"kada je datoteka učitana."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:506
msgid "Paus&e"
msgstr "Pauz&iraj"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:509
msgid "Pauses the player"
msgstr "Pauzira plejer"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:510
msgid ""
"Pause command pauses or resumes playback of the current file. This command "
"is available when the player is not idle."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Pauziraj</interface> pauzira ili nastavlja puštanje "
"tekućeg datoteke. Naredba je dostupna kad plejer nije u mirovanju."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:515
msgid "&Stop"
msgstr "Zau&stavi"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:518
msgid "Stops the player"
msgstr "Zaustavlja plejer"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:519
msgid ""
"Stop command stops playback of the current file. This command is available "
"when the player is not idle."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Zaustavi</interface> zaustavlja puštanje tekuće datoteke. "
"Naredba je dostupna kad plejer nije u mirovanju."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:524 kplayernodeview.cpp:3408
msgid "&Forward"
msgstr "&Naprijed"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:526
msgid "Moves playback forward"
msgstr "Pomera puštanje unaprijed"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:527
msgid ""
"Forward command moves playback forward by one percent of the time length of "
"the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Napred</interface> pomera puštanje unaprijed za jedan "
"procenat ukupne dužine trajanja tekuće datoteke. Naredba je dostupna tokom "
"puštanja."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:532
msgid "F&ast Forward"
msgstr "&Brzo naprijed"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:535
msgid "Moves playback forward fast"
msgstr "Pomera puštanje brzo unaprijed"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:536
msgid ""
"Fast Forward command moves playback forward by ten percent of the time "
"length of the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Brzo napred</interface> pomera puštanje unaprijed za "
"deset procenata ukupne dužine trajanja tekuće datoteke. Naredba je dostupna "
"tokom puštanja."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:541
msgid "&Backward"
msgstr "Na&zad"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:543
msgid "Moves playback backward"
msgstr "Pomera puštanje unazad"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:544
msgid ""
"Backward command moves playback backward by one percent of the time length "
"of the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Nazad</interface> pomera puštanje unazad za jedan "
"procenat ukupne dužine trajanja tekuće datoteke. Naredba je dostupna tokom "
"puštanja."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:549
msgid "Fast Back&ward"
msgstr "Brzo naza&d"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:552
msgid "Moves playback backward fast"
msgstr "Pomera puštanje brzo unazad"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:553
msgid ""
"Fast Backward command moves playback backward by ten percent of the time "
"length of the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Brzo nazad</interface> pomera puštanje unazad za deset "
"procenata ukupne dužine trajanja tekuće datoteke. Naredba je dostupna tokom "
"puštanja."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:558
msgid "Back &to Start"
msgstr "Nazad na p&očetak"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:561
msgid "Moves playback to the beginning"
msgstr "Pomera puštanje na početak"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:562
msgid ""
"Back to Start command moves playback to the beginning of the current file. "
"This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Nazad na početak</interface> vraća puštanje na početak "
"tekuće datoteke. Naredba je dostupna tokom puštanja."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:567
msgid "&Increase Volume"
msgstr "Povećaj jač&inu zvuka"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:569
msgid "Increases the volume"
msgstr "Povećava jačinu zvuka"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:570
msgid "Increase Volume command increases the sound volume."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Povećaj jačinu zvuka</interface> povećava jačinu zvuka."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:575
msgid "&Decrease Volume"
msgstr "S&manji jačinu zvuka"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:577
msgid "Decreases the volume"
msgstr "Smanjuje jačinu zvuka"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:578
msgid "Decrease Volume command decreases the sound volume."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Smanji jačinu zvuka</interface> smanjuje jačinu zvuka."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:583
msgid "&Mute"
msgstr "&Umukni"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:586
msgid "Turns the sound on/off"
msgstr "Uključuje/isključuje zvuk"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:587
msgid "Mute command turns the sound on or off."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Umukni</interface> potpuno isključuje ili uključuje zvuk."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:594
msgid "Maintain &Aspect"
msgstr "Očuvaj &proporciju"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:597
msgid "Maintains the video aspect ratio"
msgstr "Održava proporciju slike videa"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:598
msgid ""
"Maintain Aspect command toggles the option to maintain the video aspect "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Očuvaj proporciju</interface> uključuje ili isključuje "
"opciju za očuvanje proporcije slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:608
msgid "Shows player progress and allows seeking"
msgstr "Prikazuje napredak i dozvoljava traženje"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:609
msgid "Progress slider shows playback progress and allows seeking."
msgstr "Klizač napretka prikazuje napredak puštanja i dozvoljava traženje."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:616
msgid "Changes volume level"
msgstr "Mijenja nivo jačine zvuka"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:617
msgid ""
"Volume slider shows the current sound volume level and allows you to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Klizač jačine zvuka prikazuje trenutni nivo jačine zvuka i omogućava da ga "
"mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:625
msgid "Shows the volume popup slider"
msgstr "Prikazuje klizač jačine zvuka"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:626
msgid ""
"Volume button displays a slider that shows the current sound volume level "
"and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Dugme jačine zvuka prikazuje klizač koji pokazuje trenutni nivo jačine zvuka "
"i omogućava da ga mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:639
msgid "&Load Subtitles..."
msgstr "Učitaj &titlove..."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:641
msgid "Opens a subtitle file"
msgstr "Otvara datoteku sa titlovima"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:642
msgid ""
"The 'Load Subtitles' command displays the standard Open File dialog and "
"allows you to choose a subtitle file to use with the current file or URL. If "
"you load subtitles when a video is playing, KPlayer will display the "
"subtitles immediately. By default it will also remember the subtitles you "
"choose in the current file's properties. This command is available for video "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Učitaj titlove</interface> prikazuje standardni dijalog "
"za otvaranje datoteke i omogućava da izaberete datoteku sa titlovima koji će "
"se koristiti sa tekućim datotekom ili URL‑om. Ako učitate titlove dok je "
"puštanje u toku, K‑plejer će je ponovo pokrenuti sa titlovima. "
"Podrazumijevano je i da se titlovi koje izaberete upamte u svojstvima tekuće "
"datoteke. Naredba je dostupna za video datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:647
msgid "&Full Screen"
msgstr "&Pun ekran"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:650
msgid "Switches to full screen mode"
msgstr "Prebacuje u režim punog ekrana"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:651
msgid ""
"The 'Full Screen' command switches between full screen video display and "
"normal mode."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Pun ekran</interface> prebacuje prikaz videa iz prozora u "
"pun ekran i obrnuto."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:655
msgid "Enlarges the video"
msgstr "Uvećava sliku"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:656
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom In' command enlarges the video area by one half of the original "
"video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj</interface> uvećava oblast slike za polovinu "
"originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:660
msgid "Shrinks the video"
msgstr "Skuplja sliku"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:661
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom Out' command reduces the video area by one half of the original "
"video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Umanji</interface> smanjuje oblast slike za polovinu "
"originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:669
msgid "Zoom to 5&0%"
msgstr "Uveličaj na 5&0%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:671
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 50% of its original size"
msgstr "Smanjuje sliku na 50% originalne veličine"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:673
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom to 50%' command resizes the video area to one half of the original "
"video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj na 50%</interface> mijenja veličinu slike na "
"polovinu originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:678
msgid "Zoom to &100%"
msgstr "Uveličaj na &100%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:680
msgid "Scales video to its original size"
msgstr "Vraća sliku na njenu originalnu veličinu"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom to 100%' command resizes the video area to the original video size "
"of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj na 100%</interface>  vraća veličinu slike na "
"originalnu veličinu tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:687
msgid "Zoo&m to 150%"
msgstr "Uveličaj na 1&50%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:689
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 150% of its original size"
msgstr "Uvećava sliku na 150% od njene originalne veličine"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:691
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom to 150%' command resizes the video area to 150% of the original "
"video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj na 150%</interface> mijenja veličinu slike na "
"150% od originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:696
msgid "Zoom to &200%"
msgstr "Uveličaj na &200%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:698
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 200% of its original size"
msgstr "Uvećava sliku na 200% od originalne veličine"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:700
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom to 200%' command resizes the video area to twice the original "
"video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj na 200%</interface> mijenja veličinu slike na "
"200% od originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:705
msgid "Zoom &to 250%"
msgstr "Uveličaj &na 250%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:707
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 250% of its original size"
msgstr "Uvećava sliku na 250% od originalne veličine"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:709
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom to 250%' command resizes the video area to 250% of the original "
"video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj na 250%</interface> mijenja veličinu slike na "
"250% od originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:714
msgid "Zoom to &300%"
msgstr "Uveličaj na &300%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:716
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 300% of its original size"
msgstr "Uvećava sliku na 300% od originalne veličine"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Zoom to 300%' command resizes the video area to three times the "
"original video size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Uveličaj na 300%</interface> mijenja veličinu slike na "
"300% od originalne veličine tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:726
msgid "Maintain Original &Aspect"
msgstr "Očuvaj originalnu &proporciju"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:727
msgid "Maintains the original video aspect ratio"
msgstr "Održava originalnu proporciju slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:728
msgid ""
"The 'Maintain Original Aspect' command toggles the option to maintain the "
"original video aspect ratio of the current file."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Očuvaj originalnu proporciju</interface> uključuje ili "
"isključuje opciju za očuvanje originalne proporcije slike tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:735
msgid "Maintain &Current Aspect"
msgstr "Očuvaj &trenutnu proporciju"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:736
msgid "Maintains the current video aspect ratio"
msgstr "Održava trenutnu proporciju slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:737
msgid ""
"The 'Maintain Current Aspect' command toggles the option to maintain the "
"current video aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Očuvaj trenutnu proporciju</interface> uključuje ili "
"isključuje opciju za očuvanje trenutne proporcije slike tekuće datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:742
msgid "Force &4-to-3 Aspect"
msgstr "Nametni proporciju &4:3"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:743
msgid "Sets a 4-to-3 video aspect ratio"
msgstr "Postavlja proporciju na 4:3"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:744
msgid ""
"The 'Force 4-to-3 Aspect' command toggles the option to maintain a four-to-"
