#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:43
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Poruke"

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Message log is a window where KPlayer shows messages it receives from "
"MPlayer. KPlayer can show it automatically when it detects an MPlayer error "
"if that option is selected in KPlayer settings."
msgstr ""
"Dnevnik poruka je prozor gdje K‑plejer prikazuje poruke koje dobija od "
"M‑plejera. K‑plejer ga može prikazati automatski, kada detektuje grešku "
"M‑plejera, ako je ta opcija izabrana u postavkama."

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:115 kplayernodeview.cpp:3369
msgid "&Select All"
msgstr "&Izaberi sve"

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:116
msgid "Selects all messages in the message log"
msgstr "Označava sve poruke iz dnevnika"

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:117
msgid "The 'Select All' command selects all messages in the message log."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Izaberi sve</interface> označava sve poruke iz dnevnika "
"poruka."

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:121
msgid "&Copy"
msgstr "&Kopiraj"

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:122
msgid "Copies the text selected in the message log to the clipboard"
msgstr "Kopira izabrani tekst iz dnevnika u klipbord."

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:123
msgid ""
"The 'Copy' command copies the text selected in the message log to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Kopiraj</interface> kopira označeni tekst iz dnevnika "
"poruka u klipbord."

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:127
msgid "C&lear"
msgstr "O&čisti"

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:128
msgid "Clears all messages from the message log"
msgstr "Briše sve poruke iz dnevnika"

#: kplayerlogwindow.cpp:129
msgid "The 'Clear' command removes all messages from the message log."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Očisti</interface> uklanja sve poruke iz dnevnika poruka."

