#: kplayerpropertiesadvanced.ui:151 kplayerpropertiesadvanced.ui:173
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:166 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:188
msgid "Choose whether and how MPlayer should drop frames"
msgstr "Izaberite da li i kada M‑plejer treba da ispusti kadrove"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_frame_drop)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_frame_drop)
#: kplayerpropertiesadvanced.ui:154 kplayerpropertiesadvanced.ui:176
msgid ""
"If your system is too slow to play this file, MPlayer can drop some frames "
"so playback does not slow down. Default uses the default from KPlayer "
"Settings, None disables dropping, Soft drops fewer frames, and Hard drops "
"more frames and may sometimes break decoding. If you select a frame dropping "
"option from Player menu while holding Shift key, KPlayer will remember that "
"choice in this property for the currently loaded file."
msgstr ""
"Ako je vaš sistem previše spor za puštanje ove datoteke, M‑plejer može "
"ispustiti poneki kadar da puštanje ne bi bilo previše sporo. "
"„Podrazumijevano“ koristi postavke K‑plejera, „nema“ isključuje ispuštanje, "
"„slabo“ ispušta poneki kadar dok „jako“ ispušta dosta kadrova i ponekad može "
"dovesti do prekida dekodiranja. Ako izaberete opciju ispuštanja kadra iz "
"menija Plejer držeći taster Shift, K‑plejer će zapamtiti taj izbor u "
"svojstvima za trenutno učitani datoteku."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_frame_drop)
#: kplayerpropertiesadvanced.ui:157 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:172
