#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:346
msgid "&by"
msgstr "&sa"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, l_full_screen)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, c_full_screen)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:378 kplayerpropertiessize.ui:400
msgid "Initial full screen window state"
msgstr "Pun ekran na početku"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_full_screen)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_full_screen)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:381 kplayerpropertiessize.ui:403
msgid ""
"Option to choose whether to start playing this file in a full screen window. "
"Default does not change the window state for this file. It is easier to set "
"this property by switching to full screen or restoring KPlayer window while "
"holding the Shift key down."
msgstr ""
"Opcija kojom se određuje da li će se puštanje datoteke odvijati u punom "
"ekranu, maksimizovanom ili normalnom prozoru. „Podrazumijevano“ ne mijenja "
"stanje prozora za ovu datoteku. Ovo svojstvo je lakše podesiti tako što ćete "
"se prebaciti u pun ekran, maksimizovati prozor ili vratiti na normalno dok "
"držite taster Shift pritisnut."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_full_screen)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:384
msgid "&Full screen:"
msgstr "&Puni ekran:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, l_maximized)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, c_maximized)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:425 kplayerpropertiessize.ui:447
msgid "Initial maximized window state"
msgstr "Maksimizovano stanje prozora na početku"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_maximized)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_maximized)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:428 kplayerpropertiessize.ui:450
msgid ""
"Option to choose whether to start playing this file in a maximized or normal "
"window. Default does not change the window state for this file. If the full "
"screen option is also set, it will take precedence. It is easier to set this "
"property by maximizing or restoring the KPlayer window while holding the "
"Shift key down."
msgstr ""
"Opcija kojom se određuje da li će se puštanje datoteke odvijati u punom "
"ekranu, maksimizovanom ili normalnom prozoru. „Podrazumijevano“ ne mijenja "
"stanje prozora za ovu datoteku. Ovo svojstvo je lakše podesiti tako što ćete "
"se prebaciti u pun ekran, maksimizovati prozor ili vratiti na normalno dok "
"držite taster Shift pritisnut."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_maximized)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:431
msgid "&Maximized:"
msgstr "&Maksimizirano:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, l_maintain_aspect)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, c_maintain_aspect)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:478 kplayerpropertiessize.ui:500
msgid "Maintain video aspect when resizing window"
msgstr "Čuva proporciju videa pri mijenjanju veličine prozora"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_maintain_aspect)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_maintain_aspect)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:481 kplayerpropertiessize.ui:503
msgid ""
"Option to maintain video aspect when resizing the KPlayer window. Default "
"leaves the maintain aspect option unchanged for this file. It is easier to "
"set this property by clicking the Maintain Aspect button on the main KPlayer "
"toolbar while holding the Shift key down."
msgstr ""
"Opcija za očuvanje proporcije slike pri mijenjanju veličine prozora "
"K‑plejera. „Podrazumijevano“ ostavlja opciju za očuvanje proporcije ove "
"datoteke nepromijenjenu. Ovo svojstvo je lakše podesiti tako što ćete "
"kliknuti na dugme Očuvaj proporciju na traci alatki K‑plejera dok držite "
"taster Shift pritisnut."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_maintain_aspect)
#: kplayerpropertiessize.ui:484
msgid "Mai&ntain aspect:"
msgstr "Ču&vaj proporciju:"

