#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_vobsub)
#: kplayerpropertiessubtitles.ui:118 kplayerpropertiessubtitles.ui:140
msgid ""
"Option to specify the type of the external subtitle file. Usually you can "
"let KPlayer determine the type automatically. One exception is when you "
"specify a VobSub .sub file in the external path field. In that case you have "
"to select the VobSub option here."
msgstr ""
"Opcija kojom se navodi vrsta datoteke spoljašnjeg titla. Obično možete "
"pustiti da K‑plejer sam odredi vrstu. Izuzetak je kada navedete Vobsabov ."
"sub datoteku u polju spoljašnje putanje. U tom slučaju morate ovdje izabrati "
"opciju Vobsab."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_vobsub)
#: kplayerpropertiessubtitles.ui:121
msgid "E&xternal type:"
msgstr "V&anjski tip"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, c_vobsub)
#: kplayerpropertiessubtitles.ui:149
msgid "vobsub"
msgstr "Vobsab"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, c_vobsub)
#: kplayerpropertiessubtitles.ui:154
msgid "normal"
msgstr "normalno"

