"<interface>Dodaj na listu numera</interface> mogu imati."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_playlist_menu_size)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntSpinBox, c_playlist_menu_size)
#: kplayersettingsgeneral.ui:62 kplayersettingsgeneral.ui:102
